The '''Listehol Run'''<ref name="Scarif" /> was a [[hyperspace route]] in the northeastern corner of the [[Outer Rim Territories]]. The route began at [[Listehol]] on the [[Hydian Way]] and ran south to [[Mirial]], before winding east to [[Pippip 3]], [[Gigor]], and [[Basta Core]] before ending at [[Zygerria]]<ref name="Map" /> which was situated along the [[Shaltin Tunnels]] route.<ref name="Scarif" />

